# Site-specific deployment values. Copy to `deployment.env` and fill in.
#
#   cp deploy/deployment.env.example deploy/deployment.env
#
# `deployment.env` is gitignored. Nothing in it is a secret — these are account
# and host identifiers, and every action against them still requires an IAM
# principal you control. They are kept out of the repository because this one is
# public, and an account number plus an instance id plus a registry host is a
# free inventory of your infrastructure for anyone who wants one.
#
# Real secrets do not belong here either. They live in SSM Parameter Store under
# /commissionwatch/ and are fetched by the host with its instance role; see
# `deploy/README.md` and the note about SSM command payloads in CLAUDE.md.
#
# `deploy/deploy-aws-ssm.sh` and `deploy/monitor-trigger.sh` source this file if
# it exists. An explicit environment variable always wins over it, so a one-off
# deploy to somewhere else needs no edit here. CI reads the same values from
# Gitea repository variables instead — see `.gitea/workflows/deploy.yml`.

# ── AWS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The account that owns the ECR repositories and the instance.
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=123456789012
AWS_REGION=us-west-2

# The EC2 instance the stack runs on, addressed by id over SSM. There is no
# hostname and no SSH key: SSM needs neither.
INSTANCE_ID=i-0123456789abcdef0

# The ECR path prefix. Required, and not cosmetic — the CI user's policy grants
# push only on repository/<namespace>/commissionwatch-*.
ECR_NAMESPACE=your-org

# Derived from the two above; override only if your registry is elsewhere.
# ECR_REGISTRY=123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-west-2.amazonaws.com

# ── Gitea ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by deploy/monitor-trigger.sh to dispatch the monitor workflow from an
# always-on machine, because scheduled workflows do not run on this Gitea. The
# token for it lives in ~/.config/commissionwatch/gitea.env, not here.
GITEA_URL=https://gitea.example.invalid
GITEA_REPO=your-org/commissionwatch
